ble.sh for Debian
=================

ble.sh is not enabled automatically. To use it in your interactive Bash
sessions, add this line near the TOP of ~/.bashrc:

  [[ $- == *i* ]] && source /usr/share/blesh/ble.sh --noattach

and this line at the very END of ~/.bashrc:

  [[ ${BLE_VERSION-} ]] && ble-attach

Then open a new terminal. `echo $BLE_VERSION` shows the running version.

Updates come from apt (deb.griffo.io); `ble-update` is redirected there.
The vim-airline themes live in the separate ble.sh-airline-themes package.

 -- Dario Griffo <dariogriffo@gmail.com>
